OL,3,GNEWSATeenager critically injured in
OL,4,Amotorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy is in a critical
OL,7,Fcondition after the electric motorcycle
OL,8,Fhe was riding collided with a car in
OL,9,FBradford.
OL,11,FThe unregistered motorcycle collided
OL,12,Fwith a black Audi S3 on School Street
OL,13,Fin Holme Wood at about 17:20 BST on
OL,14,FThursday, West Yorkshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe 15-year-old boy remains in hospital
OL,17,Fwith a serious head injury.
OL,19,FOfficers urged witnesses or anyone with
OL,20,Ffootage to contact the force's Roads
OL,21,FPolicing Unit.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
